    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d66-a5">

                <pb facs="0180" n="74" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg74"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure D.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Consular Agent Courtade to
                        Capt. White</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Consular Agency of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">La Libertad, Salvador</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1891-08-09"><hi rendition="#italic">August 9,
                                1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">To Capt. <hi rendition="#small-caps">F. P. White</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">Commanding Steamship City of Panama, off La
                        Libertad:</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: I have just received a telegram from
                    the United States consul at San Salvador, which reads as follows: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">“San Salvador</hi>, 10:25
                            p.m.</p>
                        <p>“Please deliver at once the following to captain of the ship <hi
                                rendition="#italic">City of Panama:</hi></p>
                        <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">“Captain of the Pacific
                                Mail Ship City of Panama, at La Libertad:</hi></p>
                        <p>“Permit no one to come aboard or leave your ship, and remain there until
                            further orders from me or the Department.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">“J. W. Love</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">“Consul.”</hi></p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>I beg to transmit the same, and inclose the original telegram for your
                    guidance.</p>
                <p>Yours, truly,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. Courtade</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Consular Agent</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
